# Local records: answered by dns-cache itself, before any allow/block checks.
#   <name>  A|AAAA|CNAME|TXT  <value>
#   <ip>    <name> [<name>...]          (hosts-style shorthand for A/AAAA)
# PTR (reverse) records are generated for every address; the first name listed wins.
# A name listed here answers only from this file: a type you don't define gets an
# empty NOERROR, it is not sent upstream.
router.home    A      192.168.1.1
nas.home       A      192.168.1.10
files.home     CNAME  nas.home
